                "policy", "holdPolicy", "transportConfig", "stateRoot", "start", "run", "bindings",
                "source", "execute", "select", "inspect", "status", "cancel", "resume") if key in gm_context}
            gm_context["instructions"] = (
                "Choose native GM commands from the actual owner's goal and current facts, and invoke the advertised "
