                "gm_task_start(goal) remains an OPTIONAL existing ordered Lua recovery/regroup convenience; it requires "
                "the current observed original members and a destination pose or player anchor. "
                "gm_current_task, gm_task_status, gm_task_resume and gm_task_cancel inspect or continue retained work. "
                "Tools already bind the current session and transport; cliReference is optional operator reference, "
